config BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_SDK
	bool "sigmastar-sdk"
	depends on BR2_SOC_VENDOR_SIGMASTAR
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_LIB
	help
	  The kernel side of the SigmaStar vendor stack: the prebuilt mi_*
	  and mhal kernel modules, the sensor drivers built from source for
	  the configured Infinity family, the ISP tuning blobs and the VENC
	  firmware.

	  The vendor modules are prebuilt against Linux 4.9.84, which is why
	  this board pins that kernel: insmod checks vermagic and a mismatch
	  is fatal. The sensor drivers are compiled here and have no such
	  constraint; one is chosen at runtime by load_sigmastar from the
	  U-Boot `sensor` variable.

	  Selects sigmastar-lib, which carries the MI userspace libraries
	  the Raptor HAL dlopens. Neither half is useful alone.

	  https://github.com/johnchia/sigmastar-sdk
